;; This repo is lint-only (see README's Testing section) — clj-kondo never
;; sees the consuming app's full classpath (aozora.pds.repo, aozora.pds.
;; per-actor, aozora.appview.{feed,scan,push}, etc. all live in the
;; consumer, not here), so :unresolved-symbol/:unresolved-namespace on `js`,
;; `js->clj`, `clj->js`, and the sibling namespaces are structurally
;; unavoidable false positives, not real signal. Structural checks
;; (unmatched/mismatched brackets, unused bindings, etc.) stay fully active
;; — those ARE meaningful without a full classpath.
{:linters {:unresolved-symbol {:level :off}
           :unresolved-namespace {:level :off}}}
